{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":180,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1890577,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":280917,"Name":"shauna6","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280917.jpg?_r=1414609199","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":263,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1427183360,"LastPoster":{"Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1890577,"PostDate":1427183360,"PostContent":"Hello brides! \u00a0 My fiance and I planning to get married this year in November and are scrambling...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sghofran@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.139.86.3","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414607477,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280917.jpg?_r=1414609199","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":263,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shauna6","Id":280917,"Name":"shauna6","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"101.99.34.40","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a7f486449da6abb32d3efe50db2d29d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello brides!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fiance and I planning to get married this year in November and are scrambling to find a venue that is available in Tulum. There are only a couple venues available for our date and we have narrowed it down to Piedra Escondida or ZAMAS.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I like how Piedra Escondia has its own private beach which will give us an intimate wedding but I think I like the layout of the Zamas restaurant more. I am basing everything on pictures, reviews, etc as neither of us have been to Tulum. If any of you have visited either hotel I would really appreciate your thoughts!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks all!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Frantic bride to be...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Shauna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890577,"PostDate":1427183360,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello brides!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance and I planning to get married this year in November and are scrambling to find a venue that is available in Tulum. There are only a couple venues available for our date and we have narrowed it down to Piedra Escondida or ZAMAS.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I like how Piedra Escondia has its own private beach which will give us an intimate wedding but I think I like the layout of the Zamas restaurant more. I am basing everything on pictures, reviews, etc as neither of us have been to Tulum. If any of you have visited either hotel I would really appreciate your thoughts!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks all!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Frantic bride to be...<\/p>\n<p>Shauna<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sghofran@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.139.86.3","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414607477,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280917.jpg?_r=1414609199","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":263,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shauna6","Id":280917,"Name":"shauna6","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.121.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"30354ae3d3664719a3341f659a97d60c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Shauna!\n\nI understand you are \"frantic\", picking a venue is hard if you don&#039;t know the destination! I&#039;d like to offer up a couple of other ideas for &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/tulum\/&#039;&gt;Tulum weddings&lt;\/a&gt;, some really beautiful venues available.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/akiin-beach-club\/&#039;&gt;Akiin Beach club weddings&lt;\/a&gt; are great, they have a beautiful beach, a large palapa and a coordination team that ensures that YOUR tastes are satisified, very personal detailed service.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80586-akiin-beach-club-wedding\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_11383.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_11383.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80588-akiinbeachclubreception\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_79360.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_79360.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80587-akiin-beach-club-wedding\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_244995.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_244995.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/las-ranitas\/&#039;&gt;Las Ranitas weddings&lt;\/a&gt;, wow, this place is great. Exceptional beach, pretty terraces, a pool (not common in Tulum) and a big beautiful palapa restaurant. This &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/vanessa-seumas-las-ranitas-destination-wedding\/&#039;&gt;Las Ranitas wedding&lt;\/a&gt; of Vanessa and Seumas is one of our all time faves for sure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80589-las-ranitas-tulum-wedding\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_2962.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_2962.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80591-las-ranitas-tulum-wedding\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_458003.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_458003.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80592-las-ranitas-tulum-wedding\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_170936.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_170936.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/cabanas-la-luna\/&#039;&gt;Cabanas La Luna weddings&lt;\/a&gt; are the third option I will share, they are so charming and intimate. We recently shot a &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/cabanas-la-luna-wedding-tulum-lr-03112015\/&#039;&gt;Cabanas La Luna wedding&lt;\/a&gt; just for two, bride and groom traveled from Italy to have a totally romantic wedding day. When the garden is set up with the twinkling lights, lanterns and candles, it is gorgeous!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80594-cabanas-la-luna-tulum-wedding\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_57468.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_57468.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80593-cabanas-la-luna-tulum-wedding\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_390890.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_390890.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80595-cabanas-la-luna-tulum-wedding\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_64464.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_64464.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So many options it is a tough decision! Definitely check out as many photos and reviews as you can to get the \"vibe\" of the place and ensure it matches your vision. All the best, happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890614,"PostDate":1427217239,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Shauna!<br>\nI understand you are \"frantic\", picking a venue is hard if you don't know the destination! I'd like to offer up a couple of other ideas for <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/tulum\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Tulum weddings<\/a>, some really beautiful venues available.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/akiin-beach-club\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Akiin Beach club weddings<\/a> are great, they have a beautiful beach, a large palapa and a coordination team that ensures that YOUR tastes are satisified, very personal detailed service.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80586-akiin-beach-club-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_11383.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_11383.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80588-akiinbeachclubreception\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_79360.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_79360.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80587-akiin-beach-club-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_244995.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_244995.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/las-ranitas\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Las Ranitas weddings<\/a>, wow, this place is great. Exceptional beach, pretty terraces, a pool (not common in Tulum) and a big beautiful palapa restaurant. This <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/vanessa-seumas-las-ranitas-destination-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Las Ranitas wedding<\/a> of Vanessa and Seumas is one of our all time faves for sure.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80589-las-ranitas-tulum-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_2962.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_2962.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80591-las-ranitas-tulum-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_458003.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_458003.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80592-las-ranitas-tulum-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_170936.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_170936.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/cabanas-la-luna\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cabanas La Luna weddings<\/a> are the third option I will share, they are so charming and intimate. We recently shot a <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/cabanas-la-luna-wedding-tulum-lr-03112015\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cabanas La Luna wedding<\/a> just for two, bride and groom traveled from Italy to have a totally romantic wedding day. When the garden is set up with the twinkling lights, lanterns and candles, it is gorgeous!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80594-cabanas-la-luna-tulum-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_57468.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_57468.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80593-cabanas-la-luna-tulum-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_390890.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_390890.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80595-cabanas-la-luna-tulum-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_64464.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_64464.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So many options it is a tough decision! Definitely check out as many photos and reviews as you can to get the \"vibe\" of the place and ensure it matches your vision. All the best, happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175019240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"180.150.148.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cecf4dc55f8219f7aa2fc075bf402bf2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Matt,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\nThank you for the suggestions! I would love to have my wedding at Las Ranitas but they are undergoing renovations and won&#039;t be open in November which is when my wedding is. The other venues you mentioned are already hosting weddings as well so that&#039;s why I am debating between Piedra Escondida or Zamas or maybe I can rent a private beach villa and host the wedding there. It&#039;s just difficult deciding when you have never visited the area, haha.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-s&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890714,"PostDate":1427259003,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Matt,<\/p>\n<p>\nThank you for the suggestions! I would love to have my wedding at Las Ranitas but they are undergoing renovations and won't be open in November which is when my wedding is. The other venues you mentioned are already hosting weddings as well so that's why I am debating between Piedra Escondida or Zamas or maybe I can rent a private beach villa and host the wedding there. It's just difficult deciding when you have never visited the area, haha.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-s<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sghofran@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.139.86.3","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414607477,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280917.jpg?_r=1414609199","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":263,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shauna6","Id":280917,"Name":"shauna6","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.239.11.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a2208020b1dbefc6fd890d09d9493184","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What abotu Xcaret?&amp;nbsp; it&#039;s beautiful and they have animals.&amp;nbsp; Who doesn&#039;t love animals?!&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.xcaretweddings.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.xcaretweddings.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890735,"PostDate":1427291564,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What abotu Xcaret?\u00a0 it's beautiful and they have animals.\u00a0 Who doesn't love animals?!\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.xcaretweddings.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.xcaretweddings.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cynthiameegan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"12.239.11.130","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426784965,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"purplekitten","Id":282471,"Name":"purplekitten","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.109.52","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"115cd31afab51aefb88f1f1eacceac86","RawContent":"[quote name=\"shauna6\" post=\"1890714\" timestamp=\"1427259003\"]\n\n\nHi Matt,\nThank you for the suggestions! I would love to have my wedding at Las Ranitas but they are undergoing renovations and won&#039;t be open in November which is when my wedding is. The other venues you mentioned are already hosting weddings as well so that&#039;s why I am debating between Piedra Escondida or Zamas or maybe I can rent a private beach villa and host the wedding there. It&#039;s just difficult deciding when you have never visited the area, haha. \n\n-s[\/quote]\nHi Shauna,\nLove the idea of a [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/private-villa-wedding\/\"]private villa wedding[\/url] (this link will show you all our weddings in private villas). Tulum is fantastic and nearby Soliman Bay has a unique venue called \"[url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/casa-buena-suerte\/\"]Casa Buena Suerte[\/url]\".  Here are some pics of the venue:\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80703-casa-buena-suerte\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_182407.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80705-casa-buena-suerte\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_93261.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80706-casa-buena-suerte\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_193965.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80707-casa-buena-suerte\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_142087.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80708-casa-buena-suerte\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_105309.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80709-casa-buena-suerte\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_28176.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tulum-wedding-casa-chic-ks-10142013\/\"]Casa Chic Tulum weddings[\/url] are intimate and romantic!\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80710-casa-chic-tulum\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_166559.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80713-casa-chic-tulum\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_280220.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80712-casa-chic-tulum\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_244844.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\nThere are many private villas available in Puerto Aventuras as well, [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/hacienda-del-secreto\/\"]Hacienda del Secreto[\/url], [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/hacienda-corazon\/\"]Hacienda Corazon[\/url], and [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/hacienda-del-mar\/\"]Hacienda del Mar[\/url] just to name a few. \n\nHope that gives you some more ideas for intimate villa weddings!","Attachments":[],"Id":1890743,"PostDate":1427296529,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>shauna6, on 24 March 2015 - 08:50 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><br><div><br><p>Hi Matt,<\/p>\n<p>Thank you for the suggestions! I would love to have my wedding at Las Ranitas but they are undergoing renovations and won't be open in November which is when my wedding is. The other venues you mentioned are already hosting weddings as well so that's why I am debating between Piedra Escondida or Zamas or maybe I can rent a private beach villa and host the wedding there. It's just difficult deciding when you have never visited the area, haha.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-s<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi Shauna,<\/p>\n<p>Love the idea of a <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/private-villa-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>private villa wedding<\/a>\u00a0(this link will show you all our weddings in private villas). Tulum is fantastic and nearby Soliman Bay has a unique venue called \"<a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/casa-buena-suerte\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Casa Buena Suerte<\/a>\". \u00a0Here are some pics of the venue:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80703-casa-buena-suerte\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_182407.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_182407.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80705-casa-buena-suerte\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_93261.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_93261.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80706-casa-buena-suerte\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_193965.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_193965.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80707-casa-buena-suerte\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_142087.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_142087.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80708-casa-buena-suerte\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_105309.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_105309.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80709-casa-buena-suerte\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_28176.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_28176.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tulum-wedding-casa-chic-ks-10142013\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Casa Chic Tulum weddings<\/a> are intimate and romantic!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80710-casa-chic-tulum\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_166559.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_166559.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80713-casa-chic-tulum\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_280220.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_280220.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80712-casa-chic-tulum\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17993\/gallery_207303_17993_244844.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17993_244844.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There are many private villas available in Puerto Aventuras as well, <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/hacienda-del-secreto\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Hacienda del Secreto<\/a>, <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/hacienda-corazon\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Hacienda Corazon<\/a>, and <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/hacienda-del-mar\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Hacienda del Mar<\/a> just to name a few.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that gives you some more ideas for intimate villa weddings!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175019240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78973","Title":"Tulum Wedding Venues","LastPostDate":1427296529},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
